# HTML sinks in src/ that have been read and found safe (scripts/html-sinks.mjs).
# One line per sink: the file, a tab, the trimmed text of the line. Comments say why.
# Text from a player, the island or the browser's storage never reaches one of these
# unescaped: it goes in as textContent, or through the html`` tag (src/ui/html.ts),
# which escapes every ${…} with esc() (src/ui/esc.ts).

